I(1,[1,2],'unproved claim',[61,62],'6–49','et s’induisent mutuellement; par les arguments à la M.L.','For a compatible quasi-coherent coefficient system on the ordinary infinitesimal neighborhoods of the diagonal, affine stratifying cohomology is computed by the completed cosimplicial section complex; in general use its Zariski hypercohomology and the first-quadrant spectral sequence.','Modern formulation uses Rlim and Tot; the pages write ordinary inverse limits. Surjectivity follows on affine sections from the inserted pullback compatibility, not from quasi-coherence alone.','agrees','Both insertions on scan61 and the cosimplicial/hypercohomology statement on62 are present. The prior run correctly makes the omitted limit justification conditional on compatibility.')
