I(5,[6],'unpursued implication',[66],'113–120','ne dépend pas ... de la façon dont on a relevé; on verra','For a smooth lift X/S of X0/S0 across a nilpotent base immersion, infinitesimal cohomology is independent of the lift. Over a Q-base its comparison with relative de Rham cohomology yields canonical stratification; the page further anticipates Rf*Ω as an absolute crystal.','Interpreting characteristic zero as a Q-scheme and keeping the derived object are modern precision. Smooth quasi-projective f is what the inserted text states.','agrees','The future-tense comparison and stronger derived-crystal expectation are distinguished by the notes; they do not revive the earlier positive-characteristic unrestricted claim.')
